(6654311, 992836, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light.. a signature image.</td>', 'Wonderful light.. a signature image.', '2012-01-25 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654698, 992686, 124190, '<td valign="top">Smile!!!!   This is FANTASTIC!   I would LOVE to hear you describe how you did this.   This would be a good tutorial.  OK....don''t take this the wrong way....your expression hearkens to the look my children''s middle school principal would wear walking down the empty halls on patrol during class time...I was a sub sometimes...and when I saw him coming...I''d hide!  But you are so creative!  SMILE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   please tell me you weren''t watching football......lolol    LOVE THIS WORK!</td>', 'Smile!!!!   This is FANTASTIC!   I would LOVE to hear you describe how you did this.   This would be a good tutorial.  OK....don''t take this the wrong way....your expression hearkens to the look my children''s middle school principal would wear walking down the empty halls on patrol during class time...I was a sub sometimes...and when I saw him coming...I''d hide!  But you are so creative!  SMILE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   please tell me you weren''t watching football......lolol    LOVE THIS WORK!', '2012-01-25 11:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654703, 992669, 124190, '<td valign="top">.....at least your toe nails are clean.......</td>', '.....at least your toe nails are clean.......', '2012-01-25 11:21:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654706, 992686, 763, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LoVi:</b></div><hr/><i> Smile!!!!   This is FANTASTIC!   I would LOVE to hear you describe how you did this.   This would be a good tutorial.  OK....don''t take this the wrong way....your expression hearkens to the look my children''s middle school principal would wear walking down the empty halls on patrol during class time...I was a sub sometimes...and when I saw him coming...I''d hide!  But you are so creative!  SMILE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   please tell me you weren''t watching football......lolol    LOVE THIS WORK! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! I just tried to have a blank expression. Funny, I don''t scare too many kids normally! :-)<br/> <br/>I wrote about making this on my blog here: //myylc.wordpress.com/2012/01/14/speed-challenge-a-new-avatar/<br/> <br/>Try it...it isn''t difficult to do.</td>', 'Originally posted by LoVi: Smile!!!!   This is FANTASTIC!   I would LOVE to hear you describe how you did this.   This would be a good tutorial.  OK....don''t take this the wrong way....your expression hearkens to the look my children''s middle school principal would wear walking down the empty halls on patrol during class time...I was a sub sometimes...and when I saw him coming...I''d hide!  But you are so creative!  SMILE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   please tell me you weren''t watching football......lolol    LOVE THIS WORK!   Thank you! I just tried to have a blank expression. Funny, I don''t scare too many kids normally! :-) I wrote about making this on my blog here: //myylc.wordpress.com/2012/01/14/speed-challenge-a-new-avatar/ Try it...it isn''t difficult to do.', '2012-01-25 11:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6654709, 993038, 124190, '<td valign="top">you kinda look like half a Jesus with a crown.......and the tower looks like a stoned rabbit   I guess the two together could conceivably have an interesting conversation   probably telepathic    from the looks of it......  can you hold that expression if someone tickles the bottom of your foot?</td>', 'you kinda look like half a Jesus with a crown.......and the tower looks like a stoned rabbit   I guess the two together could conceivably have an interesting conversation   probably telepathic    from the looks of it......  can you hold that expression if someone tickles the bottom of your foot?', '2012-01-25 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
